Z||000000||Cozmo||05-27-2001||08:35 AM||||Finally got it running...<BR>A plugged fuel line, so simple but it took me a while to find it. Now to take her out and play (it's a beautiful day in the neighborhood)! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/targadiagfrontsmall.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/targarearsmall.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/targaeng1small.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/targatopsmall.JPG"> <P>Now to start on the <B>Cozmetics</B> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR><B>C02M0</B><BR><I>Suncoast Fieros</I><BR>'85 silver 2M6 4spd. Targa <B>"Silver Streak"</B><BR>'86 black auto GT <B>"Blackbird"</B><BR>'87 white auto Coupe <B>"The Duke"</B>||||reg||10
